---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="QA Agents | Little Bytes case study"
  description="A static evidence-first QA investigation."
  canonicalPath="/projects/qa-agents/demo/"
>
  <main class="document-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Recorded case study</p>
    <h1>Passing tests, missing evidence</h1>
    <p>
      A controlled Little Bytes pricing change altered quantity-plus-discount
      behavior while the existing tests remained green.
    </p>
    <ol>
      <li>The behavior changed.</li>
      <li>Configured tests passed.</li>
      <li>The changed combination lacked direct regression evidence.</li>
      <li>
        The investigation recorded a gap and suggested a focused human-reviewed
        test.
      </li>
    </ol>
    <h2>What did not happen</h2>
    <p>
      No browser mission, agent dispatch, generated test, patch, pull request,
      or merge decision occurred. The outcome demonstrates evidence and
      responsibility boundaries, not autonomous execution.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/haleyparks329/qa-agents"
        >Explore the public case-study repository</a
      >
    </p>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
